fact WorkItem(id: "WI-305", description: some(value: "Retire the operation-body term handle entirely. After WI-304 (op-body occurrence built natively) and WI-252 (NodeOccurrence rename), the term handle from convert_expr_term is still built and stored only to fill OperationInfo.body and OperationImpl.body, which no consumer reads as a term (all read kb.op_body_node). Drop both fact body fields and stop building the handle: (a) remove the body field from the OperationInfo entity (reflect.anthill) and OperationImpl (realization.anthill); (b) migrate the only logical use of body presence — the typer/spec OperationInfo(body: some(_)) has-body check (docs/proposals/typing_pass_spec.anthill ~410,796) — to derive has-body from kb.op_body_node instead; (c) in load.rs load_operation, stop building/storing the handle (convert_expr_term need only return the NodeOccurrence) once nothing needs the TermId; keep set_op_body_node. Then materialize_from_handle is gated only by its remaining callers (rule-body reflect atoms in build_body_atom_occurrence, the apply_subst reify path). Acceptance: OperationInfo/OperationImpl have no body field; no convert_expr_term handle stored; cargo test green; typing_pass_spec loads with no NEW warnings."), context: none, acceptance: [ToolPasses(tool: "cargo-test", params: none)], depends_on: some(value: ["WI-252"]), generates: none, requires_capability: none, status: Delivered(agent: "claude", at: "2026-05-24T16:51:09Z"))

fact Feedback(workitem: "WI-305", author: "user", content: "Delivered commit f8d0ea4. Added reflect builtin operation_body(op) -> Option[NodeOccurrence] (reads op_body_node, builds some(value: Value::Node)/none() as occurrences via match_view; arg0 non-Symbol fails cleanly). Dropped OperationInfo.body + OperationImpl.body; load_operation no longer stores the handle (still built transiently in convert_expr_term, which the native node-build reads — fully term-free node-build is a WI-304 follow-on). typing.rs operation_has_no_body migrated to op_body_node (OperationInfo-existence gate preserved). typing_pass_spec migrated to operation_body. Tests: new wi305 resolver test + 6 load_operation parse tests + 4 cpp-gen diag dumps migrated to op_body_node. materialize_from_handle now has NO op-body caller (remains for rule-body reflect atoms + the apply_subst reify path). Note: diag_phase_b fails at LOAD on a pre-existing malformed-source bug (x.name resolution in (p).x/?p.y), unrelated to WI-305 — fixture cleanup (WI-258 territory). Full workspace 1238 green; multi-agent code-review clean after the two fixes.", at: "2026-05-24T16:51:09Z")
